### BugBoard API requests. Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, Rider and Visual Studio.
### Start the API first:  dotnet run --launch-profile http   (from backend/BugBoard.Api)

@host = http://localhost:5082

### 1. Log in as a Tester. The token is saved into {{token}} for the requests below.
# @name loginTester
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tester1@bugboard.local", "password": "Tester1Pass!" }

###
@token = {{loginTester.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Who am I?
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Users (for the assignee dropdown)
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. List bugs: filters + search + paging
GET {{host}}/api/bugs?status=Open&severity=High&search=login&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. One bug
GET {{host}}/api/bugs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Create a bug  -> 201 + Location header
POST {{host}}/api/bugs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Created from the .http file", "description": "Optional text", "severity": "High", "assignedToId": 3 }

### 7. Create with invalid data -> 400 with a per-field errors map
POST {{host}}/api/bugs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "abc", "severity": "High" }

### 8. Update (reporter or Lead only; Closed needs a Lead; Closed bugs are locked -> 409)
PUT {{host}}/api/bugs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Login button unresponsive on Safari", "description": "Updated", "severity": "High", "status": "InProgress", "assignedToId": 3 }

### 9. Delete as a Tester -> 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/bugs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. No token at all -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/bugs

### 11. Log in as the Lead
# @name loginLead
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lead@bugboard.local", "password": "LeadPass123!" }

###
@leadToken = {{loginLead.response.body.accessToken}}

### 12. Delete as a Lead -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/bugs/12
Authorization: Bearer {{leadToken}}
